<chapter xml:id="ch-let-the-study-learn" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Let the Study Learn</title>

  <introduction>
    <p>
      Asks what another season adds and how early learning should shape the next stage. Repetition, piloting, revised measurements and repeated farmer contact serve different purposes. The late-planting discussion develops from recording a date into understanding decisions and constraints. Historical climate records and crop simulation broaden the enquiry beyond the few seasons a project can observe.
    </p>
  </introduction>

